short_label: VII.21
---
sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: Numbers relatively prime are the least of those which have the same ratio with them.
----
proof:

Let *A* and *B* be numbers relatively prime.

I say that *A* and *B* are the least of those which have the same ratio with them.

